{"id":"8f93c57db760a2b7","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-hierarchical-truth.md","title":"层次真理","display":"df-hierarchical-truth — 层次真理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-hierarchical-truth","aliases":["91-df-hierarchical-truth","91-df-hierarchical-T","91-df-Tarski-hierarchy"],"display":"df-hierarchical-truth — 层次真理","depends_on":["[[91-df-typed-truth]]","[[91-df-type-index]]","[[91-df-truth-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-hierarchical-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-hierarchical-truth</span><span>91-df-hierarchical-T</span><span>91-df-Tarski-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hierarchical-truth — 层次真理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00a1e20ba65f1f5a\" href=\"?note=00a1e20ba65f1f5a\" title=\"91-df-typed-truth\">91-df-typed-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19dd1f8599ff0195\" href=\"?note=19dd1f8599ff0195\" title=\"91-df-type-index\">91-df-type-index</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-hierarchical-truth-—-层次真理-$\\mathrm{HierT}$\">df-hierarchical-truth — 层次真理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HierT}\">\\(\\mathrm{HierT}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (对前驱封闭的序数指标集)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle T_\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\in I\\rangle\">\\(\\langle T_\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\in I\\rangle\\)</span> (不同的真理谓词符号)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> (不含任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span> 的基础语言)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha\\)</span> 是下述定义的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 层去引号公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in I\">\\(\\alpha\\in I\\)</span>，其真理谓词为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span>，实例域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T_\\beta\\mid\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T_\\beta\\mid\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha\\coloneqq\n\\{T_\\alpha(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha\\coloneqq\n\\{T_\\alpha(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HierT}(I)\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha,\\,\n\\langle\\mathcal L_\\alpha,T_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha\\in I}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HierT}(I)\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha,\\,\n\\langle\\mathcal L_\\alpha,T_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha\\in I}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span> : 第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>层的真理谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_\\alpha\\)</span> : 包含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{T_\\beta : \\beta &lt; \\alpha\\}\">\\(\\{T_\\beta : \\beta &lt; \\alpha\\}\\)</span>的语言</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HierT}\">\\(\\mathrm{HierT}\\)</span> : 层次真理系统</li>\n</ul>\n<p>层次真理的核心思想：\n通过将真理谓词分层，避免自指：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0 \\subset \\mathcal{L}_1 \\subset \\mathcal{L}_2 \\subset ...\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{L}_0 \\subset \\mathcal{L}_1 \\subset \\mathcal{L}_2 \\subset ...\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha \\text{ 适用于 }\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\text{-句子，并首次出现在 }\\mathcal L_{\\alpha+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_\\alpha \\text{ 适用于 }\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\text{-句子，并首次出现在 }\\mathcal L_{\\alpha+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>层次真理与说谎者：\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T_\\alpha(x)\">\\(\\neg T_\\alpha(x)\\)</span> 的对角句属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\alpha+1}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\alpha+1}\\)</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha\\)</span> 只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\)</span> 句给出双条件，因而不能把该对角句代入自身层的 T-模式。</p>\n<p>层次真理的性质：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>相对一致性</td>\n<td>合适基础模型可逐层扩张时得到</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层内析取</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\)</span> 满足相应模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级长度</td>\n<td>取决于目标理论，不能由定义断言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 层足够</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>层次真理的限制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>语言复杂性无限增长</li>\n<li>不能表达&quot;全真&quot;（truth simpliciter）</li>\n<li>不能自然处理自然语言中的真理</li>\n</ul>\n<p>层次真理的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tarski避免悖论的标准方案</li>\n<li>类型化真理理论的理论基础</li>\n<li>展示了真理分层的技术可能性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-hierarchical-truth-—-层次真理-$\\mathrm{HierT}$","text":"df-hierarchical-truth — 层次真理 $\\mathrm{HierT}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-typed-truth","status":"resolved","id":"00a1e20ba65f1f5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-typed-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-type-index","status":"resolved","id":"19dd1f8599ff0195","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-type-index]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{HierT}","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle T_\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\in I\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T_\\beta\\mid\\beta<\\alpha\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha\\coloneqq\n\\{T_\\alpha(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HierT}(I)\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha,\\,\n\\langle\\mathcal L_\\alpha,T_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha\\in I}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"T_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\{T_\\beta : \\beta < \\alpha\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HierT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0 \\subset \\mathcal{L}_1 \\subset \\mathcal{L}_2 \\subset ...","display":true},{"tex":"T_\\alpha \\text{ 适用于 }\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\text{-句子，并首次出现在 }\\mathcal L_{\\alpha+1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg T_\\alpha(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\alpha+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2510,"backlinks":[{"id":"fa7a47e0464f94a4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6b23223b4dd97161","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4fb5cfb29c2f255e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TB}_i$ ($T_i$ 对 $\\math